WEBVTT

00:27.160 --> 00:30.560
♪Peach blossoms fall,
yesterday's trace fades away♪

00:30.800 --> 00:34.080
♪Ahead lie storms and winds,
our fates like drifting clouds sway♪

00:34.400 --> 00:40.040
♪Alas, I roam through what remains,
fate's grip won't set me free♪

00:41.400 --> 00:44.920
♪If time would spare me
just one breath to stay♪

00:45.520 --> 00:48.920
♪If you could see
the depth of my belief♪

00:49.120 --> 00:55.680
♪Alone I enter the game,
every move made with no regret in me♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.040
♪Though shackles bind my soul
and chain my form♪

01:00.160 --> 01:03.240
♪I've walked
through life and death before♪

01:03.320 --> 01:10.200
♪I fear not fate's cruel temptations,
I've severed every cause♪

01:10.400 --> 01:14.440
♪In this life our threads entwined,
in love and pain we crossed♪

01:14.600 --> 01:17.480
♪But I'll keep my word
no matter the cost♪

01:17.560 --> 01:19.960
♪Forged in stardust and flame♪

01:20.040 --> 01:25.800
♪I rise with an unyielding frame♪

01:35.120 --> 01:36.960
=The Princess's Gambit=

01:37.040 --> 01:39.440
(Adapted from the novel "Peach Blossoms
Reflecting the River and Mountains")

01:39.520 --> 01:42.000
(by Bai Lu Cheng Shuang)

01:42.160 --> 01:44.920
=Episode 30=

01:54.160 --> 01:54.760
It's falling.

01:55.960 --> 01:56.640
This is not good.

01:58.360 --> 02:00.120
Empress Lv planned
everything far too well.

02:00.640 --> 02:02.120
There's more than one signal lantern.

02:02.600 --> 02:03.360
They're too far

02:03.680 --> 02:04.320
to shoot down.

02:05.880 --> 02:07.480
We need to warn the people quickly.

02:09.199 --> 02:11.360
I'll meet up with Zhan Lu
and try to reduce casualties.

02:13.840 --> 02:14.480
Shen Zaiye.

02:22.120 --> 02:23.640
If we make it through this alive,

02:24.240 --> 02:24.840
I…

02:36.880 --> 02:37.800
Be careful.

02:48.000 --> 02:48.680
You too.

03:04.320 --> 03:05.920
Someone, store all the saltpeter.

03:07.360 --> 03:07.960
There's danger!

03:08.040 --> 03:09.120
Everyone, get out of the city!

03:09.200 --> 03:10.280
There's going to be a fire!

03:11.120 --> 03:11.800
Danger!

03:11.880 --> 03:12.960
A fire's about to break out!

03:13.160 --> 03:13.960
Get out of the city!

03:14.200 --> 03:15.400
Danger! Run!

03:16.120 --> 03:17.240
A fire's about to break out!

03:17.360 --> 03:18.400
Get out of the city!

03:18.600 --> 03:19.680
There's going to be a fire!

03:25.400 --> 03:26.440
Leave the city now!

03:44.080 --> 03:45.960
When I was little,
I loved hearing you talk

03:46.800 --> 03:48.600
about Beiyuan's Sky Lantern Festival.

03:50.520 --> 03:51.920
Then you came to Beiyuan,

03:52.520 --> 03:53.920
and I started dreaming

03:56.440 --> 03:59.080
of lighting lanterns with you.

04:01.440 --> 04:03.880
If only you spent that much effort
on state affairs,

04:04.360 --> 04:07.240
Qi would've been yours by now.

04:07.800 --> 04:09.600
But I only want to belong to you.

04:15.240 --> 04:16.560
Then you'd better behave.

04:17.200 --> 04:18.240
Everything's in motion.

04:19.959 --> 04:21.040
I've stationed shadow guards

04:21.120 --> 04:22.640
throughout the city with gunpowder.

04:24.400 --> 04:25.720
Once the lanterns fall,

04:26.200 --> 04:27.680
they'll light the fires.

04:30.520 --> 04:33.240
Tonight, I'm going to wipe them all out.

04:34.520 --> 04:35.600
After that,

04:36.440 --> 04:37.240
no one

04:37.320 --> 04:38.840
can keep us apart.

04:49.880 --> 04:51.160
The signals are sent.

04:52.760 --> 04:53.360
Come.

04:54.120 --> 04:55.200
We need to leave the city.

05:06.640 --> 05:10.040
(Luocheng)

05:19.600 --> 05:20.680
Fire!

05:20.800 --> 05:21.640
Fire!

05:22.560 --> 05:24.040
Hurry! Save the people.

05:25.960 --> 05:27.000
Save my child!

05:27.280 --> 05:28.600
Save my child!

05:30.760 --> 05:32.360
Help me save them!

05:32.840 --> 05:33.800
Here. He's safe now.

05:34.200 --> 05:35.000
Thank you, sir!

05:35.080 --> 05:36.040
Thank you so much, sir.

05:36.480 --> 05:37.080
Thank you, sir.

05:37.280 --> 05:38.760
Move! Get everyone out!

05:38.880 --> 05:39.720
Fire!

05:39.880 --> 05:40.480
Sir!

05:41.000 --> 05:42.080
Save them!

05:43.160 --> 05:43.880
Help!

05:43.960 --> 05:44.800
Fire!

05:44.880 --> 05:45.680
Help!

05:46.760 --> 05:47.880
Put out the fire!

05:50.520 --> 05:52.440
Don't panic.
Leave from the back entrance.

05:53.600 --> 05:54.400
Go! Hurry!

06:03.880 --> 06:04.480
Your Highness.

06:04.720 --> 06:05.800
- Your Highness.
- Hurry.

06:06.120 --> 06:07.120
Be careful.

06:07.720 --> 06:08.680
- Make haste.
- Hurry!

06:09.720 --> 06:10.680
Move out of the way.

06:13.240 --> 06:14.200
(Commandant's Residence)

06:14.280 --> 06:16.120
There are so many explosions already.

06:16.200 --> 06:18.320
Commandant Deng,
don't tell me you're still unsure?

06:18.400 --> 06:20.320
Sir, fires are breaking out
all over the city.

06:20.960 --> 06:23.920
Someone just came with Empress Lv's seal
and took control of the gate!

06:24.560 --> 06:25.200
What?

06:25.760 --> 06:26.600
Impossible.

06:27.200 --> 06:28.640
Once Empress Lv locks down the city,

06:29.400 --> 06:30.600
not just the citizens,

06:31.120 --> 06:31.920
even you and I

06:33.680 --> 06:35.920
won't make it out of the city alive.

06:36.240 --> 06:36.920
Commandant Deng,

06:37.080 --> 06:39.520
attempting to please both sides
will earn you nothing,

06:39.600 --> 06:41.040
or satisfy Empress Lv.

06:41.920 --> 06:43.760
It won't save the people you care about.

06:47.800 --> 06:48.600
All troops, listen up!

06:48.680 --> 06:49.560
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

06:49.640 --> 06:51.200
One unit, put out the fires.

06:51.720 --> 06:53.960
The rest, come with me
and Prince Changjue

06:54.560 --> 06:55.520
to evacuate the citizens!

06:55.600 --> 06:56.640
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

06:57.080 --> 06:58.720
Run for your lives!

06:58.800 --> 06:59.560
Run!

06:59.720 --> 07:00.320
Run!

07:01.560 --> 07:02.600
Come on, run!

07:02.960 --> 07:03.880
Head for the gates!

07:03.960 --> 07:04.720
Run for your lives!

07:04.840 --> 07:06.200
(The smoke is thick now.)

07:06.840 --> 07:09.440
(I hope the drum draws them
to the gate.)

07:14.040 --> 07:14.640
Hurry!

07:14.760 --> 07:15.360
Quickly!

07:16.040 --> 07:16.920
Move it!

07:21.680 --> 07:22.280
Water!

07:22.720 --> 07:23.320
Water.

07:23.880 --> 07:24.520
Water is here.

07:24.840 --> 07:25.640
Lend a hand quickly.

07:25.720 --> 07:27.000
- Put it out together!
- Coming!

07:27.080 --> 07:28.440
Bring the water here quickly!

07:30.400 --> 07:31.360
Help me clear this path!

07:31.440 --> 07:32.040
Coming!

07:32.920 --> 07:33.960
Hurry! More water!

07:36.280 --> 07:37.120
Follow the drumbeats!

07:37.400 --> 07:38.240
Head for the gates!

07:38.320 --> 07:39.600
Head for the outer city! Hurry!

07:40.280 --> 07:40.880
Watch your steps!

07:40.960 --> 07:41.960
Don't lose your footing!

07:42.840 --> 07:43.600
Help the weak!

08:14.320 --> 08:14.920
Who's there?

08:32.520 --> 08:33.720
Chancellor, are you all right?

08:34.520 --> 08:35.640
Secure the saltpeter.

08:36.400 --> 08:37.000
Hurry.

08:52.400 --> 08:53.000
Your Highness,

08:53.400 --> 08:55.080
most people have moved
to the outer city.

09:11.680 --> 09:12.280
Let's go.

09:18.080 --> 09:18.800
It's Empress Lv.

09:19.160 --> 09:19.760
Let's go.

09:27.480 --> 09:28.080
Hua,

09:28.760 --> 09:29.960
Jiang Taohua saw us.

09:30.200 --> 09:31.560
You should leave the city first.

09:32.240 --> 09:33.200
Let me handle the rest.

09:57.400 --> 09:58.720
Let my mother go!

09:58.880 --> 10:00.280
Let her go!

10:00.360 --> 10:01.480
Force it down her throat!

10:06.320 --> 10:07.800
I've been nothing but kind to you.

10:08.400 --> 10:09.560
Why are you doing this…

10:10.480 --> 10:12.720
But you're sitting on the throne
that you shouldn't have.

10:13.160 --> 10:14.240
If I don't get rid of you,

10:14.760 --> 10:17.520
how can I rule this harem?

10:26.520 --> 10:27.120
Hua,

10:30.480 --> 10:31.120
go first.

10:31.800 --> 10:32.440
I'll cover you.

10:35.200 --> 10:36.320
I'll wait outside the city.

10:48.880 --> 10:49.480
Stop her.

11:00.200 --> 11:00.960
Leave no one alive.

11:01.640 --> 11:02.240
Kill her.

11:16.080 --> 11:16.680
Your Highness!

11:21.280 --> 11:22.480
Jiang Taohua.

11:38.440 --> 11:40.240
The one commanding at the gates
is Cui Wei.

11:40.320 --> 11:42.200
He's one of Empress Lv's
most loyal servants.

11:43.000 --> 11:44.640
Chancellor Shen was right again.

11:44.920 --> 11:46.880
(Outside Luocheng City)
Empress Lv's shadow guards

11:46.960 --> 11:49.040
(Outside Luocheng City)
must be waiting for her.

11:51.280 --> 11:51.920
Yes.

12:05.480 --> 12:06.080
Your Highness.

12:12.720 --> 12:13.320
Attack!

12:16.080 --> 12:17.000
Protect Her Highness!

12:25.920 --> 12:27.080
Your Highness, this way.

12:32.640 --> 12:33.400
Stop them!

12:37.400 --> 12:38.520
Chancellor, the water's here!

12:40.480 --> 12:41.080
Chancellor!

12:43.880 --> 12:44.480
Chancellor!

12:45.200 --> 12:46.920
- Where's Taohua?
- We ran into Empress Lv.

12:47.080 --> 12:48.440
Mu Wuyin captured Her Highness.

12:49.200 --> 12:50.440
Chancellor, save Her Highness.

12:50.520 --> 12:51.280
Leave this to us!

12:53.080 --> 12:53.720
Take me to her!

12:53.840 --> 12:54.440
All right.

12:57.920 --> 12:59.640
Your Highness,
that must have startled you.

13:00.160 --> 13:01.080
Please forgive us.

13:02.200 --> 13:02.840
It's fine.

13:03.320 --> 13:05.600
I knew Shen Zaiye's shadow guards
wouldn't go down easily.

13:05.680 --> 13:07.600
That's why I doubled the security
just in case.

13:08.600 --> 13:09.280
Your Highness.

13:09.800 --> 13:11.400
Now that you're safely out of the city,

13:11.920 --> 13:13.440
shall we lock down the city?

13:18.600 --> 13:19.560
Give him some time.

13:31.440 --> 13:32.600
You're about to die.

13:33.560 --> 13:35.840
You might as well reflect on your life

13:36.960 --> 13:38.240
before it's too late.

13:40.640 --> 13:43.040
You should take your advice,

13:43.880 --> 13:45.360
or death might come so fast

13:45.920 --> 13:47.680
that you won't even have time
to regret it.

13:51.440 --> 13:52.680
With you in my hands,

13:54.880 --> 13:56.600
what can Shen Zaiye possibly do?

13:57.920 --> 13:59.120
You really are pitiful.

14:00.240 --> 14:02.320
Even now, you still don't see it.

14:03.840 --> 14:05.920
The one who came
to kill you was someone else.

14:06.960 --> 14:07.560
That person

14:08.240 --> 14:09.880
just left you here.

14:17.040 --> 14:17.920
They say

14:19.440 --> 14:21.520
a man's final words
are always honest and kind.

14:22.640 --> 14:23.480
It sounds like

14:23.920 --> 14:25.280
your condition's flaring up again.

14:25.880 --> 14:27.200
That's why you're talking nonsense.

14:27.280 --> 14:29.200
People do not always appear
as they truly are.

14:30.440 --> 14:31.600
Do you really know

14:31.680 --> 14:32.880
what kind of person Hua is?

14:36.440 --> 14:38.360
You were the one
who told Shen Zaiye about her.

14:39.520 --> 14:40.120
Tell me.

14:41.600 --> 14:42.560
What else do you know?

14:42.960 --> 14:44.560
I not only know her name,

14:45.240 --> 14:46.600
but I also know her past.

14:50.800 --> 14:52.720
I spent years living in Beiyuan.

14:53.880 --> 14:55.720
What I saw and felt was far more real

14:55.920 --> 14:57.160
than your nostalgic imagination.

14:59.200 --> 15:00.760
If anyone truly understands Hua,

15:02.280 --> 15:03.400
it's me.

15:07.280 --> 15:08.840
If there's no sincerity,

15:10.040 --> 15:11.200
even living side by side

15:11.520 --> 15:12.560
means nothing.

15:14.080 --> 15:15.200
It's all just pretense.

15:17.120 --> 15:17.920
Jiang Taohua,

15:19.680 --> 15:21.240
you have no right

15:22.600 --> 15:24.280
to judge my history with Hua.

15:24.680 --> 15:26.880
She took advantage and stepped in

15:27.240 --> 15:28.480
after your sister passed away.

15:29.640 --> 15:31.520
You truly believed it was real?

15:34.920 --> 15:36.240
Jiang Taohua, I'm warning you.

15:37.160 --> 15:38.520
Don't you dare slander her.

15:40.480 --> 15:42.480
She's the kindest person in this world.

15:44.480 --> 15:46.720
She deserves the best
this world can offer.

15:48.040 --> 15:49.400
You carry yourself like a sage

15:49.480 --> 15:51.360
who has no interest in worldly matters.

15:52.400 --> 15:53.880
I assume it was Empress Lv

15:53.960 --> 15:56.320
who told you to get involved
in this power struggle, right?

15:56.560 --> 15:58.840
Even if Hua once had true feelings
for you back then,

15:59.160 --> 16:00.360
she's not the same anymore.

16:00.920 --> 16:02.520
She has turned cold, ruthless,

16:03.520 --> 16:05.200
and consumed by her obsession
with power.

16:06.000 --> 16:06.800
And anyone

16:07.440 --> 16:09.000
can be a stepping stone for her to rise.

16:09.080 --> 16:09.960
That includes you.

16:10.160 --> 16:11.360
Power struggles are always

16:11.440 --> 16:12.560
a matter of life and death.

16:13.320 --> 16:14.560
We've schemed for years.

16:15.600 --> 16:17.600
Wasn't it all for the moment
we'd finally be free

16:18.160 --> 16:20.200
to chase what you really wanted?

16:20.880 --> 16:21.480
Enough!

16:24.400 --> 16:25.640
She is still the same person.

16:28.520 --> 16:30.000
She has never changed.

16:33.640 --> 16:35.280
Can't you hear the screams

16:36.520 --> 16:38.000
of the people?

16:39.000 --> 16:40.160
What did they ever do

16:41.000 --> 16:42.160
to deserve being dragged

16:42.800 --> 16:44.000
into this hell because of her?

16:44.080 --> 16:46.600
Son, where are you?

16:48.280 --> 16:49.480
Everything is gone!

16:49.680 --> 16:51.480
They're insignificant.

16:52.560 --> 16:54.720
You call the people insignificant.

16:55.560 --> 16:56.760
But aren't you just

16:57.520 --> 16:59.280
another pawn in Empress Lv's plan?

16:59.960 --> 17:03.680
Or is it that
you simply don't want to face it

17:05.280 --> 17:06.280
or admit it?

17:11.839 --> 17:13.400
You've already been delayed for a while.

17:14.760 --> 17:17.079
Do you really think she will wait
for you outside the city?

17:20.880 --> 17:21.599
She will.

17:24.920 --> 17:26.319
She will wait for me.

17:30.640 --> 17:31.880
She will wait for me.

17:37.080 --> 17:37.840
She will.

17:54.400 --> 17:55.120
Your Highness,

17:55.840 --> 17:56.920
everything is in place.

17:57.640 --> 17:59.640
Only Prince Wuyin hasn't arrived.

18:00.280 --> 18:01.840
We must prioritize the bigger picture.

18:02.560 --> 18:03.360
Seal the city gates.

18:05.840 --> 18:06.640
Yes, Your Highness.

18:08.200 --> 18:08.800
Move out!

18:10.320 --> 18:11.200
(Mu Wuyin,)

18:11.880 --> 18:13.120
(I gave you a chance.)

18:13.800 --> 18:15.280
(It's you who wasted it.)

18:17.080 --> 18:18.160
Have we found Empress Lv?

18:18.800 --> 18:19.440
We lost her.

18:21.360 --> 18:23.680
- Why are you closing the gate?
- Don't close the gate!

18:25.120 --> 18:25.880
Let us in!

18:25.960 --> 18:27.240
My family is still inside!

18:27.440 --> 18:28.720
Open the city gates!

18:28.800 --> 18:29.400
Open the gates!

18:29.480 --> 18:31.200
Darn it.
Empress Lv is locking down the city.

18:31.280 --> 18:33.280
The Chancellor and the rest are still
inside the city.

18:33.360 --> 18:34.480
Let's breach the city gate.

18:45.040 --> 18:45.800
Lock down the city!

18:51.920 --> 18:52.520
Hurry!

18:53.000 --> 18:53.600
Go back!

18:56.160 --> 18:58.360
- Let us out!
- Let us out!

18:58.440 --> 18:59.960
Why are you nailing the city gate shut?

19:00.440 --> 19:01.480
Let us out now!

19:01.840 --> 19:02.440
Step back!

19:03.080 --> 19:04.120
Let us out!

19:42.000 --> 19:42.920
Inform Her Highness

19:43.920 --> 19:44.600
that I'm here.

19:44.880 --> 19:45.920
Open the city gates now.

19:46.480 --> 19:47.280
Yes, Your Highness.

19:49.960 --> 19:51.040
Prince Wuyin is here!

19:51.360 --> 19:52.640
Open the city gates!

20:09.640 --> 20:10.880
Come to your senses, Mu Wuyin.

20:12.440 --> 20:14.240
This is who Empress Lv really is.

20:24.600 --> 20:26.720
(Do you really know
what kind of person Hua is?)

20:27.920 --> 20:29.120
(She has become)

20:29.680 --> 20:31.240
(cold and ruthless.)

20:31.960 --> 20:32.760
Anyone

20:33.320 --> 20:34.960
can be a stepping stone for her to rise.

20:35.040 --> 20:35.880
That includes you.

20:37.680 --> 20:39.360
I won't let my plans fall apart.

20:40.320 --> 20:41.800
We must put the bigger picture first.

20:43.640 --> 20:45.560
(Will she really wait
for you outside the city?)

20:55.600 --> 20:56.440
Hua,

20:59.720 --> 21:01.240
I'm still here.

21:05.680 --> 21:06.760
Are you leaving me behind?

21:52.560 --> 21:53.160
Let's go!

21:56.880 --> 21:57.480
Your Highness.

22:01.520 --> 22:02.200
Are you hurt?

22:02.920 --> 22:03.520
No.

22:04.080 --> 22:05.560
Empress Lv has locked down the city.

22:05.920 --> 22:06.840
What should we do now?

22:23.160 --> 22:24.000
It's all right now.

22:25.920 --> 22:27.400
You shouldn't have been so stubborn.

22:28.080 --> 22:29.560
Is dying here really worth it?

22:40.720 --> 22:41.320
It is.

22:48.480 --> 22:49.120
Your Highness.

22:51.440 --> 22:52.040
Come.

22:54.560 --> 22:55.160
Are you hurt?

22:55.480 --> 22:56.080
I'm fine.

22:56.240 --> 22:56.840
Come.

22:56.920 --> 22:57.520
Help him.

22:59.680 --> 23:00.280
Prince Wuxia?

23:00.480 --> 23:01.080
Qingying?

23:02.120 --> 23:02.720
Zaiye.

23:04.480 --> 23:05.880
So Empress Lv lured you here too.

23:16.600 --> 23:17.200
Changjue,

23:17.640 --> 23:19.280
this is Prince Wuxia of Qi,

23:19.840 --> 23:20.760
my benefactor.

23:22.440 --> 23:24.400
Thank you for looking out
for my sister.

23:24.800 --> 23:25.400
You have

23:26.680 --> 23:27.600
my deepest gratitude.

23:29.040 --> 23:29.760
Prince Changjue,

23:30.480 --> 23:31.800
Her Highness was fated to survive.

23:32.200 --> 23:33.600
I only did what anyone should.

23:35.920 --> 23:37.280
Fated to survive.

23:40.160 --> 23:41.120
Yet, we're now

23:41.560 --> 23:43.400
all trapped in Luocheng.

23:51.520 --> 23:52.120
Fusheng.

23:53.200 --> 23:53.840
Fusheng.

23:54.080 --> 23:55.320
The city has been locked down.

23:55.800 --> 23:57.000
We will all die here.

23:57.080 --> 23:57.800
I am here.

23:58.640 --> 23:59.280
Thank you, sir.

23:59.360 --> 24:00.080
Thank you so much.

24:00.680 --> 24:01.320
Has any of you

24:02.400 --> 24:03.960
seen Commandant Deng at the city gates?

24:04.200 --> 24:04.840
No.

24:05.000 --> 24:06.680
He's just another
of Empress Lv's lackeys.

24:07.240 --> 24:08.560
Why would he care about us?

24:08.640 --> 24:12.120
- That's right! Nobody cares about us!
- No one cares.

24:12.840 --> 24:14.040
No one cares about us at all!

24:19.080 --> 24:20.480
We can't sit here and wait to die.

24:21.040 --> 24:21.640
Changjue,

24:22.040 --> 24:23.080
where's the city armory?

24:23.560 --> 24:24.200
We need weapons

24:24.280 --> 24:25.440
to break through the gates.

24:25.520 --> 24:27.120
It's behind the Commandant's office.

24:27.440 --> 24:28.040
But the key

24:28.520 --> 24:30.400
is with Commandant Deng.

24:31.000 --> 24:31.600
Your Highness,

24:32.080 --> 24:33.440
those blasts we heard just now came

24:33.560 --> 24:35.560
from that direction.

24:36.040 --> 24:38.760
I'm afraid the armory
has already been destroyed.

24:51.120 --> 24:53.080
Comrades! Fight your way out!

24:55.240 --> 24:56.720
Breaking open the city gate

24:57.480 --> 24:58.160
is our only way

25:00.000 --> 25:00.880
to survive.

25:02.480 --> 25:03.720
Charge!

25:05.200 --> 25:07.120
Let's unite and break out together

25:07.440 --> 25:08.560
and fight to the end!

25:08.640 --> 25:10.600
- Fight to the end!
- To the end!

25:17.360 --> 25:18.280
Head for the gates!

25:35.400 --> 25:36.640
Heaven helps those

25:37.520 --> 25:38.600
who help themselves!

25:39.800 --> 25:41.040
If we give up,

25:41.920 --> 25:43.480
we're as good as dead!

25:55.800 --> 25:56.520
Comrades!

25:57.400 --> 25:59.240
Let's take down
that wicked empress together!

25:59.960 --> 26:01.800
Kill!

26:41.080 --> 26:41.760
Commandant Deng,

26:42.400 --> 26:43.280
I'm here to help you!

26:46.200 --> 26:46.800
Let's go.

27:00.720 --> 27:01.360
- Kill!
- Kill!

27:17.520 --> 27:18.680
There are too many archers!

27:19.080 --> 27:20.640
Find cover! Block the arrows!

27:21.040 --> 27:21.880
Qingying. Changjue.

27:22.120 --> 27:22.880
Help me cover them!

27:33.680 --> 27:34.640
Raise the shields!

27:36.240 --> 27:37.920
Don't let them take the tower!

27:51.120 --> 27:51.720
Qingtai,

27:51.800 --> 27:52.760
save the civilians!

27:52.840 --> 27:53.640
Yes, Your Highness.

27:53.720 --> 27:54.800
Come now.

28:03.480 --> 28:04.240
Taohua, watch out!

28:19.600 --> 28:20.520
Taohua, come with me!

28:23.840 --> 28:24.480
Take care of him.

28:24.560 --> 28:25.400
Yes, Your Highness.

28:29.200 --> 28:29.800
This is…

28:33.720 --> 28:35.240
Their shield formation is impenetrable,

28:35.720 --> 28:37.000
and the archers have them covered.

28:37.080 --> 28:38.440
As long as the archers are in place,

28:38.520 --> 28:39.640
we can't push forward.

28:47.320 --> 28:49.120
Then we'll use
their own methods against them.

28:49.960 --> 28:50.880
We'll blast a way out

28:51.640 --> 28:52.840
using sulfur and saltpeter

28:53.560 --> 28:55.520
in case we're attacked
from both front and rear.

28:56.000 --> 28:57.840
I've already sent
Zhan Lu, Qingtai, and Qingying

28:57.920 --> 28:59.480
to take out the archers on the flanks.

29:01.000 --> 29:01.600
Move out.

29:19.200 --> 29:19.800
Qingying,

29:20.120 --> 29:21.280
get the fire arrows ready.

29:26.200 --> 29:26.800
Three.

29:27.720 --> 29:28.320
Two.

29:29.000 --> 29:29.600
One.

29:43.440 --> 29:44.600
Hold formation!

29:49.400 --> 29:50.480
It's not working, Zaiye.

29:50.640 --> 29:51.920
It's too far to blast them!

29:52.360 --> 29:52.960
I'll do it!

30:02.680 --> 30:04.240
We're still not close enough. What now?

30:06.120 --> 30:07.520
Qingying, cover me!

30:08.480 --> 30:09.280
Be careful!

30:16.600 --> 30:17.680
Zaiye, it's dangerous!

30:22.880 --> 30:24.720
Don't let him get close! Kill him!

30:34.320 --> 30:34.960
(This distance)

30:35.680 --> 30:36.480
(should be enough.)

30:41.760 --> 30:43.200
Qingying, the fire arrows!

31:27.680 --> 31:29.920
The tower is breached!
Get ready to break down the gates!

31:30.920 --> 31:31.520
Cover me!

31:35.760 --> 31:38.920
- Charge!
- Charge!

31:47.360 --> 31:47.960
Let's go.

31:52.840 --> 31:53.440
Come on!

32:15.360 --> 32:16.120
(So)

32:17.480 --> 32:18.960
(this is what true love)

32:19.840 --> 32:21.080
(really looks like.)

32:27.200 --> 32:27.920
Chancellor Shen.

32:28.560 --> 32:30.560
Chancellor Shen,
the main gates are nailed shut.

32:30.760 --> 32:31.480
There's no way out.

32:31.560 --> 32:33.520
Empress Lv's death warriors
are waiting outside.

32:35.960 --> 32:36.960
Zaiye, what now?

32:39.160 --> 32:40.120
Blow up the city gates.

32:40.720 --> 32:41.320
All right.

32:59.520 --> 33:00.120
Fall back!

33:16.760 --> 33:18.920
I'll cover the civilians
and help them out of the city!

33:21.560 --> 33:22.680
I'll go and help Changjue.

33:22.920 --> 33:23.920
Taohua! Taohua!

33:24.440 --> 33:25.680
Qingtai, keep the Princess safe.

33:25.760 --> 33:26.880
- Yes, sir.
- Be careful.

33:27.880 --> 33:28.480
Qingying,

33:28.680 --> 33:29.680
help evacuate the people!

33:30.720 --> 33:31.320
Got it.

33:32.440 --> 33:33.440
The rest of you, follow me!

33:33.520 --> 33:35.320
Kill every last one of Empress Lv's men!

33:42.920 --> 33:43.920
Your Highness, you're…

33:46.000 --> 33:46.600
Don't stop.

33:47.040 --> 33:48.560
I don't want anyone to worry about me.

33:49.200 --> 33:49.800
Let's move it.

33:49.920 --> 33:51.200
No, the antidote is in the city.

33:51.280 --> 33:51.960
I'll go and get it.

33:52.040 --> 33:52.640
No.

33:52.840 --> 33:53.760
The fire's too fierce.

33:54.160 --> 33:56.080
The place could collapse at any moment.

33:56.680 --> 33:58.080
Why are you still here, Taohua?

33:58.400 --> 33:59.200
Her Highness is…

33:59.640 --> 34:00.240
I'm fine.

34:00.760 --> 34:02.080
Changjue, let's go.

34:02.160 --> 34:02.920
How about this?

34:03.360 --> 34:04.440
Wait for me at the quarry.

34:04.520 --> 34:05.840
After I help evacuate the people,

34:05.920 --> 34:06.720
I'll meet you there.

34:07.360 --> 34:08.280
Don't worry about me.

34:09.159 --> 34:10.600
All right. Be careful.

34:11.000 --> 34:11.600
You too.

34:12.639 --> 34:13.239
Move it!

34:14.239 --> 34:14.840
Let's go.

34:25.360 --> 34:26.320
Are you all right, madam?

34:26.400 --> 34:27.239
- Madam.
- Are you hurt?

34:27.320 --> 34:29.120
Everyone, make a run for it!
The gates are open!

34:29.199 --> 34:30.040
Run outside! Quickly!

34:30.639 --> 34:31.239
Run!

34:31.320 --> 34:32.800
Get them out! Hurry!

34:33.360 --> 34:34.120
Everyone! Run!

34:34.920 --> 34:36.800
Run for your lives now!

34:39.760 --> 34:40.719
Everyone, leave the city!

34:40.800 --> 34:42.679
The city gates are opened!
Get out of the city!

34:42.800 --> 34:44.040
- Hurry!
- Keep moving!

34:49.560 --> 34:50.239
Stay close!

34:54.880 --> 34:55.560
Keep up!

34:57.520 --> 34:58.400
Hold it!

35:01.480 --> 35:02.120
Hang in there.

35:02.200 --> 35:02.960
Just a little longer.

35:03.040 --> 35:03.640
You'll be fine.

35:04.240 --> 35:05.200
It doesn't hurt.

35:20.720 --> 35:23.320
Your hand is surprisingly soft
for someone who uses it to write.

35:24.240 --> 35:26.720
It's not rough like most men.

35:30.160 --> 35:31.000
Have you held

35:31.560 --> 35:33.520
other men's hands?

35:36.920 --> 35:37.680
My brother's.

35:39.000 --> 35:41.200
Father raised him to wield a sword
from a young age.

35:41.280 --> 35:43.240
If he didn't train hard,
how would he protect us?

35:50.280 --> 35:50.920
So,

35:51.680 --> 35:54.120
what was Chancellor Shen like
as a child?

35:55.800 --> 35:57.000
My father said

35:57.680 --> 35:59.360
my brother was just like his name,

35:59.440 --> 36:00.280
wild from the start.

36:01.480 --> 36:02.280
You, a filthy orphan.

36:02.360 --> 36:03.480
Hurry up and peel the shrimp!

36:03.560 --> 36:05.040
If you don't finish peeling them today,

36:05.120 --> 36:05.960
I'll beat you to death!

36:06.040 --> 36:06.840
Be quick about it!

36:13.760 --> 36:18.920
- Amazing!
- Awesome!

36:21.640 --> 36:22.680
- Marvelous!
- Nice!

36:22.760 --> 36:23.680
Thank you, everyone.

36:24.960 --> 36:25.960
Hey, brat. You've got guts.

36:26.040 --> 36:27.280
How dare you steal my money?

36:27.480 --> 36:28.320
Where are your parents?

36:28.400 --> 36:29.040
Look! A snake!

36:29.840 --> 36:30.440
You little…

36:30.960 --> 36:31.680
Hand over the money!

36:31.760 --> 36:32.600
Be quick about it.

36:33.560 --> 36:34.160
Stop it!

36:36.400 --> 36:37.880
- Let's get out of here.
- Run for it!

36:37.960 --> 36:38.720
Stop right there.

36:40.760 --> 36:42.480
Do you want to learn some martial arts?

36:43.400 --> 36:45.600
(Xiang Zhen'ao, Shen Zaiye's godfather)
Then call me Master.

36:45.680 --> 36:46.840
My name is Xiang Zhen'ao.

36:46.920 --> 36:48.640
I've spent my life wandering
the martial world,

36:48.720 --> 36:50.120
living by a code of justice.

36:51.120 --> 36:54.400
Master, please accept respect
from your disciple, Shen Zaiye.

36:56.120 --> 36:57.000
Get up.

36:59.320 --> 37:00.200
Good lad.

37:03.320 --> 37:04.360
This is my only daughter.

37:04.680 --> 37:05.560
Her name is Qingying.

37:05.840 --> 37:07.120
Then she's my junior sister.

37:08.360 --> 37:08.960
Good.

37:09.400 --> 37:10.280
After that,

37:10.800 --> 37:12.840
Father took us traveling
around the martial world.

37:13.480 --> 37:14.400
My brother is incredible.

37:14.480 --> 37:15.680
He quickly absorbed everything

37:15.760 --> 37:16.480
Father taught him

37:16.560 --> 37:18.440
and mastered it
as if it were second nature.

37:18.560 --> 37:19.240
Not only that,

37:19.320 --> 37:21.120
he loved lecturing me
about big ideas like

37:21.440 --> 37:24.280
governing with virtue.

37:25.320 --> 37:27.240
In any case, it was all gibberish to me.

37:27.480 --> 37:28.560
"Govern with integrity,

37:28.760 --> 37:29.800
win wars with strategy,

37:29.920 --> 37:31.560
and win the world through peace."

37:31.640 --> 37:33.600
Cousin, what does that mean?

37:33.800 --> 37:35.880
It means a country stays stable

37:36.080 --> 37:37.800
through justice and order.

37:38.320 --> 37:39.480
If you want to win,

37:39.680 --> 37:41.320
you need to fight with a strategy.

37:43.520 --> 37:44.120
Mu Wuxia,

37:45.800 --> 37:46.800
I'm talking to you.

37:46.880 --> 37:47.760
Why are you in a daze?

37:51.720 --> 37:52.800
I was just thinking

37:54.040 --> 37:56.600
Chancellor Shen really had it rough
growing up.

37:58.440 --> 37:59.960
That's why he's so protective of me.

38:00.640 --> 38:01.360
He once said

38:01.440 --> 38:02.560
he would do everything he could

38:02.680 --> 38:04.200
to make me safe and happy

38:04.800 --> 38:06.880
because he knows how hard life can be.

38:34.680 --> 38:35.680
What's wrong with Taohua?

38:38.200 --> 38:40.400
She fainted from exhaustion

38:40.480 --> 38:41.880
while helping evacuate the people.

39:00.520 --> 39:02.400
After such a battle,
a plague may soon follow.

39:03.320 --> 39:04.400
She's weak.

39:04.840 --> 39:06.960
Make sure you clean
and change her clothes regularly.

39:08.160 --> 39:09.600
Yes, Chancellor.

39:33.240 --> 39:36.080
Chancellor, Her Highness hasn't told
Prince Changjue about the poison.

39:36.160 --> 39:37.600
She doesn't want him to blame himself.

39:37.680 --> 39:38.280
All right.

39:38.560 --> 39:39.200
I won't tell him.

39:39.280 --> 39:41.400
Now, hurry up and tell me
where the antidote is.

39:42.640 --> 39:44.360
Her Highness didn't want you
to take the risk.

39:44.480 --> 39:46.240
Qingtai. If you keep stalling,

39:46.360 --> 39:46.960
it'll be too late

39:47.040 --> 39:48.160
if the antidote gets destroyed.

39:48.240 --> 39:49.440
Stop hesitating. Just tell me.

39:52.360 --> 39:57.080
We dropped it
while fighting Empress Lv's men.

40:00.680 --> 40:02.880
It probably fell near Qiao Tavern.

40:04.120 --> 40:04.760
Qiao Tavern?

40:04.840 --> 40:06.000
Take good care of Taohua.

40:16.080 --> 40:17.040
Take it.

40:17.240 --> 40:17.840
Zhan Lu,

40:17.920 --> 40:20.240
the Chancellor is heading
into the city to find the antidote.

40:30.040 --> 40:30.640
Chancellor,

40:31.920 --> 40:32.720
I'll come with you.

40:40.080 --> 40:41.440
(Qiao Tavern)

41:28.920 --> 41:29.600
Get out of here!

41:54.800 --> 41:58.000
♪The flower bloomed,
knowing nothing at all♪

41:58.080 --> 42:01.120
♪In splendor, proud and tall♪

42:02.040 --> 42:05.160
♪The flower fell, lashed by the wind♪

42:05.280 --> 42:09.040
♪In a daze,
it felt like lifetimes had thinned♪

42:09.320 --> 42:12.400
♪Petals soaked in rain♪

42:12.520 --> 42:15.840
♪Heartbreak follows again and again♪

42:16.240 --> 42:19.800
♪The flower weeps, burdened by thoughts♪

42:19.880 --> 42:25.600
♪With no one it can be brought♪

42:30.560 --> 42:37.480
♪Wishes struggle through the mire♪

42:37.920 --> 42:44.760
♪Regrets clash in hopeless fire♪

42:45.240 --> 42:52.240
♪Still I hope she'll pick the flower
kissed by dew♪

42:52.560 --> 42:56.600
♪Even if it means this flower♪

42:56.720 --> 43:03.680
♪Will be hers to give to someone new♪

43:14.800 --> 43:17.920
♪Whose eyes
did the flower's heart meet?♪

43:18.000 --> 43:21.240
♪Love and hate held back, discreet♪

43:21.600 --> 43:25.280
♪The flower withers, feelings in decay♪

43:25.400 --> 43:31.960
♪No longer needing to say♪

43:36.040 --> 43:42.960
♪Yet I still long for her in madness♪

43:43.360 --> 43:50.320
♪Unafraid of judgment or sadness♪

43:50.680 --> 43:57.680
♪Remembering the words
she spoke of flowers and skies♪

43:58.040 --> 43:59.720
♪And finding♪

43:59.800 --> 44:06.800
♪They were her gentle heart's reply♪
